<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 01:45:24 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>研究称，Temu 在广告上花费了高达 9.62 亿美元，为 Meta 平台上的假冒创作者大军提供资金</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/temu-962-million-meta-partnership-ads-fake-creators/</link><description>ORL 研究员 Vendula Prokůpková 表示，在与 Temu 合作的前 100 位影响者中，约有 73 位是假的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2286972460.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 07:49:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/temu-962-million-meta-partnership-ads-fake-creators/</guid></item><item><title>从新加坡机场配乐到新型人工智能电脑，惠普正在亚洲寻找新节奏</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/hp-asia-ai-pcs-wubble-ai-changi-airport-michael-boyle/</link><description>惠普最近在新加坡推出了创业加速器 Garage 2.0，试图在人工智能时代重振其业务。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Michael-Boyle_11.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 21:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/hp-asia-ai-pcs-wubble-ai-changi-airport-michael-boyle/</guid></item><item><title>出于黑客担忧，OpenAI 将限制对 Astra 模型高级网络功能的访问</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/openai-to-limit-release-of-its-asttra-model-astra-due-to-hacking-concerns/</link><description>在“拥抱脸”事件发生后，该公司变得格外谨慎，同时也向潜在客户推销其网络安全功能。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2278952256-e1788285981446.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 20:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/openai-to-limit-release-of-its-asttra-model-astra-due-to-hacking-concerns/</guid></item><item><title>五角大楼正在为 300 万军事和文职人员提供通过专为“战士需求”而构建的安全 AI 平台访问 ChatGPT 和 Grok 的权限</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/pentagon-chatgpt-grok-government-military-ai-members-pete-hegseth-defense-department/</link><description>此次推出将五角大楼的 GenAI.mil 平台扩展到 Gemini 之外，推动人工智能更深入地融入日常军事工作。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2288162251-e1788290315428.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 19:40:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/pentagon-chatgpt-grok-government-military-ai-members-pete-hegseth-defense-department/</guid></item><item><title>加州立法者搁置纽瑟姆的野火责任法案，称该法案对受害者来说还不够</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/california-bill-wildfire-victims-compensation/</link><description>立法上的挫折仍未解决受害者、公用事业公司、保险公司和纳税人如何分摊公用事业公司引发的火灾不断上升的成本的问题&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26236608890662-e1788297382321.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 21:27:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/california-bill-wildfire-victims-compensation/</guid></item><item><title>马克·库班 (Mark Cuban) 斥资 2500 万美元购买了一座未参观的豪宅，并以 50% 的折扣购买。他的秘密？ “最好的投资回报保证”</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/mark-cuban-bought-25-million-mansion-sight-unseen-discount-guaranteed-return-on-investment-billionaire-real-estate-strategy/</link><description>库班在一座他从未涉足过的豪宅上投入了数百万美元，但他却零后悔。这笔交易体现了亿万富翁对金钱的不同看法。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/GettyImages-2266500611-e1774020145890.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 19:42:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/mark-cuban-bought-25-million-mansion-sight-unseen-discount-guaranteed-return-on-investment-billionaire-real-estate-strategy/</guid></item><item><title>FBI 扣押了超过 56 万美元的加密货币，旨在资助哈马斯，扰乱了长达数年的筹款网络</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/fbi-hamas-crypto-donations-seizure/</link><description>此次行动还向当局提供了数千名联系哈马斯寻求捐款的人的信息。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2284371606-e1788296791279.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 21:10:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/fbi-hamas-crypto-donations-seizure/</guid></item><item><title>随着特朗普迫使美国石油公司重返委内瑞拉，雪佛龙正在委内瑞拉扩张，并有 650 亿桶石油可供争夺</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/chevron-venezuela-oil-trump-65-billion-barrels/</link><description>雪佛龙是委内瑞拉石油工业国有化近二十年后仍在运营的唯一一家美国大型石油公司。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26243863000458-e1788294888679.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 20:52:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/chevron-venezuela-oil-trump-65-billion-barrels/</guid></item><item><title>索尼和华纳音乐起诉 Anthropic 涉嫌盗窃“数万首”歌曲，其中包括《我是海象》和《哈利路亚》</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/anthropic-warner-sony-music-songs-lawsuit/</link><description>音乐出版商要求每首盗版歌曲赔偿 15 万美元，并为每条删除版权信息赔偿 2.5 万美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2289852391-e1788209792703.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/anthropic-warner-sony-music-songs-lawsuit/</guid></item><item><title>众议院以 370 票对 48 票通过，为政府提供资金至 12 月中旬，避免中期选举前政府关门，但仍需等待特朗普签署</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/bill-passed-trump-government-funding/</link><description>众议院以370票对48票通过了该法案，现在只需要唐纳德·特朗普总统签署即可。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26244607906044-e1788294792555.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 20:50:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/bill-passed-trump-government-funding/</guid></item></channel></rss>